ended grapheme cluster—the element type of a string—then the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"initializer succeeds."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example converts the position of the Unicode scalar ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"e\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"into its corresponding position in the string. The character at that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position is the composed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"é\""},{"type":"text","text":" character."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let cafe = \"Cafe\\u{0301}\"","print(cafe)","\/\/ Prints \"Café\"","","let scalarsIndex = cafe.unicodeScalars.firstIndex(of: \"e\")!","let stringIndex = String.Index(scalarsIndex, within: cafe)!","","print(cafe[...stringIndex])","\/\/ Prints \"Café\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the index passed as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sourcePosition"},{"type":"text","text":" doesn’t have an exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponding position in "},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the result of the initializer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". For example, an attempt to convert the position of the combining"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"acute accent ("},{"code":"\"\\u{0301}\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") fails. Combining Unicode scalars do not have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their own position in a string."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let nextScalarsIndex = cafe.unicodeScalars.index(after: scalarsIndex)","let nextStringIndex = String.Index(nextScalarsIndex, within: cafe)","","print(nextStringIndex)","\/\/ Prints \"nil\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/doc